To see it in your own notmuch, rebuild your database once after you
merge, since notmuch new skips files whose names did not change:

    notmuch dump > /tmp/notmuch.tags
    mv <database path>/xapian <database path>/xapian.old
    notmuch new
    notmuch restore < /tmp/notmuch.tags

